sect4.para:
This is the most likely function (alongside getHeader) for an end user to use. Values are returned as: String(Range) + "," + String(Pitch) + "," + String(Roll) + "," Error values are "-9999" (sensor error) and "-9998" (no measurement yet taken") 
@paragraph autotoc_md20 Parameters
* <tt>takeNewReadings</tt> if <tt>true</tt> run <tt>updateMeasurements</tt> before returning values. Otherwise, just return values.

@paragraph autotoc_md21 <tt>public String</tt>@ref "classSymbiontLiDAR_1a4c83d0aa98cc37aa76cff14a7ccc9e61" "`GetHeader`"<tt>()</tt>

